    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849740/extras/bb2fb24126464c0473e2c0d5879e0a49.poster.avif?t=1755194111\" width=700 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849740/extras/bb2fb24126464c0473e2c0d5879e0a49.webm?t=1755194111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849740/extras/bb2fb24126464c0473e2c0d5879e0a49.mp4?t=1755194111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Minutes Until Self-Destruction </strong>is an <i>escape room-style puzzle game</i> where you're trapped on a spaceship moments from destruction. Think fast - or get blown to pieces.<br><br>The ship is filled with interconnected puzzles and minigames that test your logic, observation, and quick thinking.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong> <br>- The entire game unfolds over a strict 5-minute timer <br>- Solve interconnected environmental puzzles to unlock new areas and ultimately defuse the self-destruction mechanism <br>- From the very start, the final goal is in plain sight <br>- Fast loading and restart times <br>- Completion timer for speed-runners<br><br>Can you outsmart the countdown before time runs out?<br><br><i>DISCLAIMER</i><br>It\u2019s a short game by design, and the time-to-complete varies depending on how quickly you can think and act. Finishing on your first try in under five minutes is possible, but very difficult.<strong> </strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849740/extras/bb2fb24126464c0473e2c0d5879e0a49.poster.avif?t=1755194111\" width=700 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849740/extras/bb2fb24126464c0473e2c0d5879e0a49.webm?t=1755194111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3849740/extras/bb2fb24126464c0473e2c0d5879e0a49.mp4?t=1755194111\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Minutes Until Self-Destruction </strong>is an <i>escape room-style puzzle game</i> where you're trapped on a spaceship moments from destruction. Think fast - or get blown to pieces.<br><br>The ship is filled with interconnected puzzles and minigames that test your logic, observation, and quick thinking.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong> <br>- The entire game unfolds over a strict 5-minute timer <br>- Solve interconnected environmental puzzles to unlock new areas and ultimately defuse the self-destruction mechanism <br>- From the very start, the final goal is in plain sight <br>- Fast loading and restart times <br>- Completion timer for speed-runners<br><br>Can you outsmart the countdown before time runs out?<br><br><i>DISCLAIMER</i><br>It\u2019s a short game by design, and the time-to-complete varies depending on how quickly you can think and act. Finishing on your first try in under five minutes is possible, but very difficult.<strong> </strong></p>",
    "short_description": "The self-destruction sequence has been activated. You have 5 minutes to solve your way out of a high-stakes, escape room-style disaster.",
